 change improves the navigation feel when panning in 3D viewports using an orthogonal projection.\r\n\r\nYou can even set `editors/3d/navigation_feel/translation_inertia` to `0.0` to match the navigation feel of the 2D editor viewport.\r\n\r\n# See it in action\r\nThe cursor no longer drifts away from the initial point (using the default editor settings):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d097bea7-2cb1-448e-be71-c4405b51ee62\r\n\r\nPanning speed is still influenced by the Maya NavigationScheme (SHIFT for a 10x speed multiplicator) and the `translation_sensitivity`, so the cursor can still drift away, but it now behaves in a more natural way.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url